# Keep deploy uploads small and fast.
#
# avian/assets alone is 490 MB of print-resolution source art. It is only ever
# read by scripts/build-illustrations.mjs on a developer's machine; the 56 MB
# web-sized output in public/illustrations is committed and is what ships.
# Including the source made `vercel deploy` push 534 MB and fail on upload.
avian/
model/
supabase/
docs/
scripts/
.screenshots/
.playwright-mcp/
README.upstream.md
STATUS.md
